			"path": "Capacitor_SMD.pretty/C_1206_3216Metric.kicad_mod",
			"provenance_note": "smart-remote v2 rev B: C13, the mic's local decoupler, moves 0805 -> 1206 because JLC has no 0805 C0G at 100nF and the Syntiant mic datasheet forbids Class 2 dielectrics near the mic. NOT interchangeable with Fuse:Fuse_1206_3216Metric, which JP1-JP6/TP1 use: that land is 1.25x1.75 at +/-1.400, this one is 1.15x1.80 at +/-1.475. VERIFIED against the Walsin MLCC datasheet 2026-08-31: Walsin gives no recommended land (normal for MLCC - they defer to IPC), so this was checked against their size table row '1206 (3216)': body 3.20 x 1.60, termination band 0.60+/-0.20. The KiCad land (1.15 x 1.8 at +/-1.475, spanning 0.90..2.05) covers the whole band (1.00..1.60) with +0.10 heel, +0.45 toe for the fillet and +0.10 side overhang - IPC-7351 nominal, and it stays correct across the band's full +/-0.20 tolerance.",
			"retrieved_at": "2026-08-31",
			"sha256": "0bbfd1e461a7affe3ccb4f4dfe2534925ca853c7537e23addb29066df8015135",
